<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Schrödinger's Chess</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #1a1a24;
      --card-bg: #262636;
      --accent: #7c5cbf;
      --text-main: #f4f4f6;
      --text-muted: #a0a0b0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 650px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .status-panel, .rules-panel {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .status-panel {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }

    .status-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .status-value {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .btn {
      background-color: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    strong {
      color: var(--text-main);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <p class="subtitle">Quantum Variant</p>
    <h1>Schrödinger's Chess</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="status-panel">
      <div>
        <div class="status-title">Current Turn</div>
        <div class="status-value" id="turn-indicator">White to Move</div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="alert('Board layout coming up next!')">New Game</button>
    </div>

    <div class="rules-panel">
      <h2>How Superposition Works</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Back-Rank Pieces:</strong> Start as undefined <em>Quantum States</em> until observed through movement.</li>
        <li><strong>Observation &amp; Collapse:</strong> Moving a piece restricts its possibilities. A diagonal move eliminates Rook and Knight options; an L-shaped move immediately forces a Knight.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Entanglement:</strong> Each side has a fixed pool of 2 Rooks, 2 Knights, 2 Bishops, and 1 Queen. Collapsing pieces limits options for remaining quantum pieces.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>